  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **The inbox table has a `FailingTimeMilliseconds` column:** how long a tessage's handling has been failing, recorded with each failed try, so that an exactly-once endpoint's retries carry across restarts. An existing database's inbox table, `<endpoint name>_InboxTessages`, lacks it: add it as `bigint NOT NULL DEFAULT 0` (`INTEGER` in SQLite), or recreate the database.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Sql.Sqlite 0.8.0-alpha (was 0.7.1-alpha), Compze.Tessaging 0.14.0-alpha (was 0.12.1-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
